[gd_scene load_steps=18 format=3]

; zone_vale_approach — the second village, sacked (WLD-05; rebuilt for the map themes,
; 2026-09-23: a village overrun by humanoid raiders).
;
; The road from Ember Hollow runs east through what is left of a walled village: burnt houses
; with no roofs, walls fallen to rubble, fires still smouldering in the ruins. The raiders who
; took it camp around it, and their chief holds the old square behind a palisade of sharpened
; stakes. Past the east gate the road goes on towards the Vale Floor.
;
; West to east: the gate from the Hollow and the shrine; masked raiders on the road; their camp
; in the north-west woods; the village — cutthroats and star throwers in the south woods, firebrands
; in the south streets, the chief's stockade in the north half; a ruined watchtower with a hedge
; wizard to the north-east; a roadblock before the east gate. Three raider standards, the map's
; shards, stand south-west, north and south-east.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id; woods and weeds are
; ScatterNodes, seeded. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act1.json. This file is
; coordinates. Generated by a script; edit the script, not this file.

